# The build needs the Go sources, the migrations and the website's own source.
# Nothing else.
tnserver
*.test
testdata/
README.md

# The website's dependencies and build output. Both are produced inside the
# image by the node stage, and sending a local copy would be slow at best --
# at worst it would let a stale `npm run build` from somebody's machine end up
# in a released image.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
